<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Atwood Oceanics upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Atwood Oceanics upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said it has upgraded its rating on Atwood Oceanics Inc to buy from neutral, citing positive developments on a number of the oil services company's rigs.</p>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it set a six-month price target of $90 to $95 a share for the stock, and raised its earnings estimate for 1998 to $6.15 from $5.65.</p>
<p>In addition, Rodman &amp; Renshaw said the company is close to securing a $100 million credit facility at a favorable interest rate. The funding is needed to upgrade rigs.</p>
<p>Atwood closed up 3/4 at 66.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
